 "notes": "Old k4 'Bass guitar' becomes Electric bass guitar; P-type/J-type flat entries converted to types; old models became archetype versions (Rickenbacker 4003 under 4001/4003, Hofner under 500/1). Added Bass VI, Alembic, Steinberger, Warwick Thumb archetypes and Acoustic bass guitar kind (new, Wikipedia). Left out: Mexican guitarrón (folk instrument, belongs with world instruments), Ken Smith and Carl Thompson extended-range basses and Bill Wyman fretless (not confirmed on a retrieved page; 5/6-string and fretless kept as types), Squier P-Bass dates and Fender Professional series (not on page). No traditions apply."
